          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">In the Fight phase, when you select this unit to fight, you can spend 1 Pain token to Empower this unit. Each time you do, select one of the following to apply to this unit until the end of the phase: Melee weapons equipped by non-Character models in this unit have an Attacks characteristic of 3.; Melee weapons equipped by non-Character models in this unit have an Attacks characteristic of 4 and the [Hazardous] ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
